{"sha": "09caa02c2ebec5057364f923fca88a7e561d29bb7056d50eaec0cfea71fd3259", "body": ["\\chapter{幂}\\label{ch:g8:powers}", "", "将一张纸对折 $10$ 次（如果你能做到！），它的厚度", "每次都会加倍，$10$ 次加倍使其厚度变为原来的", "$2^{10} = 1024$ 倍。幂是重复乘法的简写；", "本章介绍幂的记号及其运算法则，", "并特别强调 $10$ 的幂的特殊作用。", "", "\\section{定义}", "", "\\begin{definition}[幂]\\label{def:g8:powers:def}", "设数 $a$ 与整数 $n \\geq 1$：", "\\[", "a^n = \\underbrace{a \\times a \\times \\dots \\times a}_{n", "\\text{ 个因数}},", "\\]", "读作“$a$ 的 $n$ 次幂”；$a$ 为\\emph{底数}，$n$ 为", "\\emph{指数}\\index{指数}。特别地，$a^2$ 读作“$a$", "的平方”，$a^3$ 读作“$a$ 的立方”。约定如下：", "\\[", "a^1 = a,", "\\qquad", "a^0 = 1 \\ (a \\neq 0),", "\\qquad", "a^{-n} = \\frac{1}{a^n}.", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g8:powers:def}", "$3^4 = 3 \\times 3 \\times 3 \\times 3 = 81$; \\quad", "$10^3 = 1000$; \\quad $5^{-2} = \\frac{1}{25} = 0.04$; \\quad", "$(-2)^3 = -8$ 与 $(-2)^4 = +16$", "（见\\cref{ex:g8:negprod:powers}）。注意：$a^n$ 并\\emph{不}等于", "$a \\times n$：\\ $2^5 = 32$，而不是 $10$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9]", "  \\foreach \\n/\\x in {0/0, 1/1.4, 2/2.8, 3/4.2, 4/5.6} {", "    \\pgfmathsetmacro{\\h}{0.28*pow(2,\\n)}", "    \\draw[omDef, fill=omDef!20] (\\x,0) rectangle (\\x+0.9,\\h);", "    \\node[below, font=\\small] at (\\x+0.45,0) {$2^\\n$};", "    \\pgfmathtruncatemacro{\\v}{pow(2,\\n)}", "    \\node[above, font=\\small] at (\\x+0.45,\\h) {$\\v$};", "  }", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small $2$ 的幂：每根柱子都是前一根的两倍。", "通过重复相乘实现的增长", "远快于通过重复相加实现的增长。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{幂的运算法则}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[幂的运算法则]\\label{thm:g8:powers:rules}", "设非零底数 $a$，整数指数 $m$、$n$：", "\\[", "a^m \\times a^n = a^{m+n},", "\\qquad", "\\frac{a^m}{a^n} = a^{m-n},", "\\qquad", "\\left(a^m\\right)^n = a^{m \\times n},", "\\qquad", "(ab)^n = a^n b^n .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}[通过计算因数个数证明]", "$a^m \\times a^n$ 是把 $m$ 个 $a$ 与其后的 $n$ 个因数排成一列：", "共 $m + n$ 个因数。$\\left(a^m\\right)^n$ 是把由 $m$ 个因数组成的一段重复", "$n$ 次，共 $mn$ 个因数。$(ab)^n$ 含 $n$ 个字母 $a$ 与 $n$", "个字母 $b$，可以重新组合。商的法则来自于约去", "$n$ 个因数（共 $m$ 个）；若约定", "$a^0 = 1$ 与 $a^{-n} = \\frac{1}{a^n}$，它", "在 $n \\geq m$ 时仍然成立。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g8:powers:rules}", "\\[", "2^3 \\times 2^5 = 2^8 = 256,", "\\qquad", "\\frac{7^6}{7^4} = 7^2 = 49,", "\\qquad", "\\left(5^2\\right)^3 = 5^6,", "\\qquad", "2^4 \\times 5^4 = 10^4 .", "\\]", "注意：运算法则只适用于\\emph{同底数}的情形（或", "同指数的情形，对最后一个式子而言）。没有任何法则可以化简 $2^3 \\times 5^2$ ---", "只需直接计算：$8 \\times 25 = 200$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{10 的幂}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[10 的幂]\\label{prop:g8:powers:ten}", "对 $n \\geq 1$，有 $10^n = 1\\underbrace{0\\dots0}_{n}$，且", "$10^{-n} = 0.\\underbrace{0\\dots0}_{n-1}1$。幂的运算法则", "表明：10 的幂相乘时，指数相加。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g8:powers:ten}", "$10^4 \\times 10^3 = 10^7$; \\quad", "$\\dfrac{10^2}{10^5} = 10^{-3} = 0.001$。大量与微小量", "都变得易于读写：", "\\[", "\\text{十亿} = 10^9,", "\\qquad", "\\text{百万分之一} = 10^{-6}.", "\\]", "结合小数：$3.2 \\times 10^5 = 320\\,000$ 与", "$4.7 \\times 10^{-3} = 0.0047$（移动小数点，", "见\\cref{prop:g6:decimals:shift}）。这种写法的系统应用 ---", "\\emph{科学记数法} --- 将", "在\\cref{ch:g9:fractions}中展开。", "\\end{example}", ""]}